<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="description" content="A secret joke." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Joke</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        width: min(720px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 42px auto 64px;
        color: #1d1d1d;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      A man walks into a bar, sits down, and pulls a tiny, one-foot-tall man and a
      miniature grand piano out of his bag. The tiny man sits down and begins
      beautifully playing a classical masterpiece.
    </p>
    <p>
      The bartender is amazed and asks, "Wow, where did you get that?"
    </p>
    <p>
      The man replies, "There is a genie in a bottle in the alleyway out back
      granting everyone one wish."
    </p>
    <p>
      The bartender immediately runs out the back door. A few minutes later, he
      bursts back into the bar, slams the door shut, and is completely surrounded
      by millions of quacking ducks flooding the room.
    </p>
    <p>
      Furious, the bartender yells to the man, "That genie is completely deaf! I
      asked him for a million bucks, and he gave me a million ducks!"
    </p>
    <p>
      The man orders another drink, shakes his head, and replies:
    </p>
    <p>
      "Do you really think I wished for a 12-inch pianist?"
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
